## MongoDB Collections

| Collection | Managed by | Documents contain |
|---|---|---|
| `OHLCVData` | `MongoHandler` | `symbol`, `interval`, `timestamp`, OHLCV floats, `expireAt` (60-day TTL) |
| `contradict_trades` | `MongoHandler` | `symbol`, `entry_price`, `stop_loss`, `target`, `sentiment`, `timestamp` |
| `simulated_trades` | `MongoHandler` | `symbol`, `signal`, `entry_price`, `stop_loss`, `take_profit`, `sentiment`, `outcome`, `duration_seconds`, timestamps |
| `sentiment_history` | `MongoDBManager` | Full sentiment analysis records |
| `trends` | `MongoDBManager` | Aggregated sentiment trend data |

OHLCV documents have a compound unique index on `(symbol, interval, timestamp)` — duplicate inserts are silently ignored via `insert_many(ordered=False)`.

