## Binance API Endpoints Used

| Method | Endpoint | Used by | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/fapi/v1/ticker/price` | `AuthenticationManager`, `OrderManager` | Current mark price |
| `GET` | `/fapi/v2/positionRisk` | `TradeChecker` | Active positions |
| `POST` | `/fapi/v1/order` | `OrderManager` | Place LIMIT / MARKET order |
| `DELETE` | `/fapi/v1/order` | `OrderManager` | Cancel order |
| `GET` | `/fapi/v1/allOrders` | `OrderManager` | Query order status |
| `POST` | `/fapi/v1/leverage` | `OrderManager` | Set leverage |
| `POST` | `/fapi/v1/algoOrder` | `OrderManager` | Place conditional SL/TP |
| `DELETE` | `/fapi/v1/algoOrder` | `OrderManager` | Cancel conditional SL/TP |
| `GET` | `/fapi/v1/allAlgoOrders` | `OrderManager` | List open conditional orders |
| `PUT` | `/fapi/v1/order` | `OrderManager` | Modify existing order |
| `GET` | `/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo` | `OrderManager` | Symbol filters (cached) |
| `GET` | `/api/v3/klines` | `MongoHandler` | Historical OHLCV candles |
| `WSS` | `fstream.binance.com/stream` | `TradeChecker` | Real-time trade price stream |

